 for it, they will not attend their candidate assessment tests. But the meeting with the king leaves them with more questions and answers, as it is clear that he is hiding something.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"56231","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Impatience","synopsis":"Ed's stepmother makes a pact with the Beruze, saying that if Beruze will get rid of Ed she will sign a petition and convince her husband to sign as well. Beruze calls Ed away from Rosenstolz in false pretence and there ambushes him.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"56232","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Cold Rain","synopsis":"Ed’s horse fell into a steep valley and Ed got injured, but he is not dead. While making his way home he realizes that his father is not really sick, and goes to confront his step mother. Meanwhile, Orphe is surprised to be visited by Ed’s father and soon realizes that Ed has been set up. Together they follow Ed to Ed’s home.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"56233","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Paradise","synopsis":"Following the incident with Ed and his rising insecurities, Camus withdraws from Rosenstolz. He returns to his house but can’t find the peace he has hoped for, while Ed and Orphe meet with his brother to try and convince him to encourage Camus to return. Camus finds that he lives close to Elmunt, and the two meet on their free time.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"p