ouse because his mother is feeling depressed. Orphe realizes that Lui’s mother is depressed not only because her brother betrayed her other brother last year, but Lui refuses to tell him anything. Lui’s mother breaks down in the middle of the visit, and Naoji helps her as well as himself to find peace once again.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"56236","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Escape","synopsis":"In the middle of the day the imperial army surround Rosenstolz and accuse Lui of severe treason. Lui’s family is out of Kuchen and Lui is planning to run into hiding, while receiving help from an unexpected source. While on the run, the five Strahl candidates are intercepted by Isaac’s men, and Isaac shoots at Orphe, but misses deliberately. Ed sees him.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider"