e truth about them. Daniel continues misleading Ailos. Beruze then takes over the palace and force the king to hear his demands.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"56239","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Deadlock","synopsis":"Understanding that Beruze has made his move, Lui sets out to stop him, but Orphe, Naoji, Ed and Camus insists on coming as well. They are stopped by Ailos, but receive the unexpected support of the entire academy. Once they reach the sealed off palace, they are being shown to a tunnel by Professor Gerald, and confront with both Isaac and Beruze. Headmaster Bartholomew returns.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4120","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"771","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34662","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"85066","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"56240","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in ingle